# Usage

Call run(data) with input matching manifest.json input_schema.

## Input schema

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "files": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "files"
  ]
}
```

